    "headline": "Serasa Experian expands digital customer service with Zendesk AI",
    "deck": "A people-centered strategy is transforming the experience for consumers and businesses. Serving millions of people and companies across Brazil, Serasa Experian needed to advance its customer service strategy without compromising security, governance, or empathy. Over roughly six years of partnership with Zendesk, the company has built a digital transformation journey that now combines artificial intelligence, digital channels, and human support to deliver more efficient, personalized experiences.",
